Cell["\<\
Given the imported extinction times and population sizes, calculate the \
extinction metrics (abundance, stability, and probability of extinction) and \
create plotting arrays.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.917611060119491*^9, 
  3.917611096384572*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"85fb8b73-8d36-4e52-a522-\
